# 허용 목록 방식: 기본은 전부 제외, 올릴 것만 연다(ROM·빌드·추출 그림은 저작권·용량 때문에 절대 안 올림)
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/chocods-kr-patch/
/chocods-kr-patch/*
!/chocods-kr-patch/tools/
!/chocods-kr-patch/docs/
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/
/chocods-kr-patch/work/*
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/*.tsv
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/*.json
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/*.py
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/*.txt
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/logo/
/chocods-kr-patch/work/logo/*
!/chocods-kr-patch/work/logo/v13.png
__pycache__/
*.nds
*.bin
*.pyc
